flowchart LR
  Governance[横切治理 / IAM / Policy]
  Semantics[语义核心 / 本体 / 契约]
  Intake[需求与交互]
  Catalog[资产目录]
  Team[多智能体协作：拓扑 / Roles / Skills / Handoff]
  Workflow[确定性 Workflow / Task State]
  Tools[工具适配器]
  Runner[受控执行]
  Gate[独立质量与安全门禁]
  Release[候选交付 / 发布]
  Observe[观测 / 成本 / 生命周期]
  Intake --> Semantics
  Catalog --> Semantics
  Team --> Semantics
  Team --> Catalog
  Workflow --> Team
  Tools --> Semantics
  Runner --> Tools
  Runner --> Workflow
  Gate --> Runner
  Release --> Gate
  Release --> Catalog
  Observe --> Workflow
  Observe --> Release
  Governance -.约束.-> Team
  Governance -.约束.-> Workflow
  Governance -.约束.-> Tools
  Governance -.约束.-> Runner
  Governance -.约束.-> Gate
